{"at": "2026-11-23T19:34:39.089597+00:00", "event_id": "01M84YEF7HVNHJ8CRRDDW820DE", "event_type": "DecisionPointOpened", "payload": {"actor_id": "cli", "actor_type": "human", "decision_point_id": "01M84YEF7GB92FTFFX92HWNGPH", "input_key": "annex_drift_snapshot", "mission_id": "01M84YDPJCBFNXNWKGGVX39KCX", "mission_slug": "tom-annex-export-01M84YDP", "mission_type": "software-dev", "options": ["A: build always emits api/tom-annex.json (stamped, source_digest over catalog + classified pages, at = latest input instant); a CLI writes an opt-in committed snapshot (a registered ADR-0087 producer) and --check reports drift of that snapshot against the tree", "B: build-only artifact; --check recomputes and compares two builds, no committed snapshot (versioned snapshot deferred to #404 / counsel)", "C: committed snapshot is the source of truth; the build copies it and fails when it is stale", "Other"], "origin_flow": "specify", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "phase": "SPECIFY", "question": "api/tom-annex.json is derived at build time from committed pages, so ADR-0087's --check and the per-release snapshot need a committed file to compare. Which shape?", "recorded_at": "2026-11-23T19:34:39.089597Z", "run_id": "01M84YEF7GB92FTFFX92HWNGPH", "state_entered_at": "2026-11-23T19:34:39.088953Z", "step_id": "specify.contract.drift-and-snapshot"}}
